{
    "body_html": "<p>PesaCheck's income from July 2018 to June 2019 was $175,780 which paid for a team of 11 researchers, fact-checkers and editors working out of offices in Dar es Salaam, Kampala and Nairobi.</p>\n<!-- EMBED START Image {id: \"editor_0\"} -->\n<figure>\n    <img src=\"https://superdesk-staging.pesacheck.org/api/upload-raw/2026090808/6a9facc7d0756a69fc2a0266\" alt=\"\" />\n    <figcaption>Funding 2023</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<!-- EMBED END Image {id: \"editor_0\"} -->\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- EMBED START Image {id: \"editor_1\"} -->\n<figure>\n    <img src=\"https://superdesk-staging.pesacheck.org/api/upload-raw/2026090808/6a9face0a31c6dce9be4b918\" alt=\"\" />\n    <figcaption>Funding 2023</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<!-- EMBED END Image {id: \"editor_1\"} -->\n<p><br></p>",
